[statement]
Reduced from a layered request over Alpine v3.24 (`main` and `community`,
2026-11-11): `nextcloud32-files_pdfviewer`'s closure from v3.23
installed, `qvidcap` asked. The request needs `icu-libs` 78, and the
installed `php83-intl`, which the world needs, needs `so:libicuuc.so.76`
from the installed `icu-libs` 76. The repository offers another build of
the same `php83-intl` version that does not. apk replaces the installed
build with it, and upgrades `icu-libs`: `icu-data=78.1-r0` is required
through names each with a single candidate before `icu-libs` is installed
(`installed/a-sole-candidate-s-constraint-upgrades-an-installed-package`).
It replaces `php83-intl` first, and removes `icu-data-en`, whose
`icu-data` `icu-data-full` takes, just before installing `icu-data-full`
(`installed/a-package-losing-a-name-it-provides-is-removed-at-the-turn-of-its-successor`).

[repository]
P:icu-data-full
V:78.1-r0
p:icu-data=78.1-r0

P:icu-libs
V:78.1-r0
D:icu-data=78.1-r0
p:so:libicuuc.so.78=78.1

[repository]
C:Q1r6ayYHR1EZX8igLFfyycE+A8/Nw=
P:php83-intl
V:8.3.36-r0

P:qt6-qtbase
V:6.11.1-r0
D:so:libicuuc.so.78
p:so:libQt6Core.so.6=6.11.1

P:qvidcap
V:1.32.0-r1
D:so:libQt6Core.so.6

[installed]
P:icu-data-en
V:76.1-r1
p:icu-data=76.1-r1

P:icu-libs
V:76.1-r1
D:icu-data=76.1-r1
p:so:libicuuc.so.76=76.1

C:Q1E04x3ugVWeVKW4T0+l+WRhbOE3Q=
P:php83-intl
V:8.3.36-r0
D:so:libicuuc.so.76

P:nextcloud32
V:32.0.9-r0
D:php83-intl

P:nextcloud32-files_pdfviewer
V:32.0.9-r0
D:nextcloud32

[world]
nextcloud32-files_pdfviewer

[request]
qvidcap

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
replace php83-intl 8.3.36-r0 8.3.36-r0
remove icu-data-en 76.1-r1
install icu-data-full 78.1-r0
upgrade icu-libs 76.1-r1 78.1-r0
install qt6-qtbase 6.11.1-r0
install qvidcap 1.32.0-r1
